From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SacredTrees <121399723+SacredTrees@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] WebCore: six unused web APIs only when enabled

WebCore always built WebTransport, the Cookie Store API, Web Locks, the
Screen Wake Lock API, the Shape Detection API and speech recognition:
they had no build flag, only run-time settings, so their bindings and
classes were in the Amiga engine although nothing on the Amiga can use
them (no HTTP/3, no wake lock, no detectors, no speech service) and their
settings are off. This patch gives each one a feature flag, on by default
as before, and the Amiga port turns all six off:

- ENABLE_WEB_TRANSPORT, ENABLE_COOKIE_STORE_API, ENABLE_WEB_LOCKS,
  ENABLE_SCREEN_WAKE_LOCK, ENABLE_SHAPE_DETECTION and
  ENABLE_SPEECH_RECOGNITION (WebKitFeatures.cmake and PlatformEnable.h,
  both default on; OptionsAmiga.cmake sets them off).
- Every IDL in Modules/webtransport, cookie-store, web-locks,
  screen-wake-lock and ShapeDetection, and each SpeechRecognition IDL,
  carries its Conditional, as do the ServiceWorkerGlobalScope cookieStore
  and ServiceWorkerRegistration cookies attributes, and the event target
  and event interface lists.
- Those sources build only with their flag, except WebTransportSession.cpp,
  which the empty socket provider still needs.
- Window and ServiceWorkerGlobalScope keep no CookieStore, a service worker
  registration no CookieStoreManager (nor its cookie change subscription
  calls), a navigator no WebLockManager, and a document no WakeLockManager
  or active speech recognition without the flag; WebTransportError's heap
  cell type goes with WebTransport.

diff --git a/Source/WTF/wtf/PlatformEnable.h b/Source/WTF/wtf/PlatformEnable.h
index 9c73a375b32..317bfb6c7fa 100644
--- a/Source/WTF/wtf/PlatformEnable.h
+++ b/Source/WTF/wtf/PlatformEnable.h
@@ -637,6 +637,30 @@
 #define ENABLE_WEBXR_WEBGPU_BY_DEFAULT 0
 #endif
 
+#if !defined(ENABLE_COOKIE_STORE_API)
+#define ENABLE_COOKIE_STORE_API 1
+#endif
+
+#if !defined(ENABLE_SCREEN_WAKE_LOCK)
+#define ENABLE_SCREEN_WAKE_LOCK 1
+#endif
+
+#if !defined(ENABLE_SHAPE_DETECTION)
+#define ENABLE_SHAPE_DETECTION 1
+#endif
+
+#if !defined(ENABLE_SPEECH_RECOGNITION)
+#define ENABLE_SPEECH_RECOGNITION 1
+#endif
+
+#if !defined(ENABLE_WEB_LOCKS)
+#define ENABLE_WEB_LOCKS 1
+#endif
+
+#if !defined(ENABLE_WEB_TRANSPORT)
+#define ENABLE_WEB_TRANSPORT 1
+#endif
+
 #if !defined(ENABLE_WEBGPU)
 #define ENABLE_WEBGPU PLATFORM(COCOA)
 #endif
